      ],
      "source": "https://cityofloneoakedc.com/why-lone-oak/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office opened in Lone Oak in 1869, connecting the community to the wider world.",
